      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pasadena%2C_Texas",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In 1899, Pasadena residents founded the first independent school district in Harris County, marking a milestone in local education.",
